{"about_the_game":"A strange portal appears and attracted <strong>Steve</strong> and all his beloved bolts inside, scattering them all over the universe! <br>Embark on a colorful adventure with <strong>Steve</strong> to help him find his artifacts.<br><br>You will have to put your grey matter to the test to help Steve use the means at his disposal to recover his artifacts, while discovering varied landscapes.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/extras/Steam_Desc_Footer_2.png?t=1708529191\" /><br>During an expedition to retrieve a single bolt, Steve and his artifacts found themselves attracted into a portal that had been dozing for many years.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/extras/Desc_Intro_Portal_gif.gif?t=1708529191\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/extras/Steam_Desc_Footer_1.png?t=1708529191\" /><br>Study the levels from all angles to find all its secrets and collect the gears in various hiding places<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/extras/ezgif-6-703165a03e.gif?t=1708529191\" /><br><br><strong>Features : </strong><br>* Help Steve collect all his bolts scattered across various thematic levels.<br>* Explore various levels with their own puzzles mechanics, with a growing difficulty.<br>* Collect hidden gears on every level.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841530?t=1708529191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841530?t=1708529191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1708529191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841530/capsule_184x69.jpg?